    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors is a first person linear puzzle game where you open doors by solving puzzles involving clones. There different doors with unique mechanics. Manipulating clones will be your bread and butter, swapping with them, destroying them, stacking them. Anti-Clone zones will destroy your clones. Anti-Player zones will destroy you, Anti-Swap zones prevent swapping.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short indie game developed by one person with a singular vision. I hope you enjoy it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doors is a first person linear puzzle game where you open doors by solving puzzles involving clones. There different doors with unique mechanics. Manipulating clones will be your bread and butter, swapping with them, destroying them, stacking them. Anti-Clone zones will destroy your clones. Anti-Player zones will destroy you, Anti-Swap zones prevent swapping.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short indie game developed by one person with a singular vision. I hope you enjoy it.</p>",
    "short_description": "Doors is a short 3D sci-fi puzzle game. You and your army of clones move in unison to escape the labyrinth one puzzle at a time. Flip levers, open doors, reach high places, see from new perspectives, create clones, swap with them and destroy them to solve puzzles in a desolate landscape.",
